flowchart TD
    U([用户请求]) --> GW{{API 网关}}
    GW -->|鉴权失败| E401[401 未授权]
    GW -->|通过| RL[限流器]
    RL -->|超阈值| E429[429 限流]
    RL -->|放行| ROUTE{路由类型}

    subgraph SVC["业务服务集群"]
      direction TB
      ROUTE -->|查询| QSVC[查询服务]
      ROUTE -->|写入| WSVC[写入服务]
      QSVC --> CACHE[(Redis 缓存)]
      QSVC --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
      WSVC --> MQ[[消息队列]]
      CACHE -.缓存未命中.-> DB
      MQ --> WORKER[异步 Worker]
      WORKER --> DB
    end

    subgraph OBS["可观测性"]
      direction LR
      LOG[日志采集]
      MET[指标 Prometheus]
      TRACE[链路追踪]
    end

    QSVC --> LOG
    WSVC --> LOG
    QSVC --> MET
    WORKER --> TRACE
    MQ --> TRACE

    DB --> RESP[响应聚合]
    CACHE --> RESP
    RESP --> OUT([JSON 响应])

    classDef err fill:#3d1f25,stroke:#f85149,color:#ffdcd7,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef cache fill:#3a2f18,stroke:#d29922,color:#ffe9b0
    classDef store fill:#173a2c,stroke:#3fb950,color:#c9f7d8
    class E401,E429 err
    class CACHE,MQ cache
    class DB store
